				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-6415246/how-do-i-delete-articles#post-4326029</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 09 Aug 2019 08:00:52 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>5567479</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I see people compare this to Procrastinati a lot, but I don't feel like those comparisons do Procrastinati justice. The difference between this and Procrastinati is that Procrastinati is a joke. It has a setup and a punchline, and it gives the impression that a modicum of thought went into it despite its short length. This, on the other hand, is a fairly common newbie mistake that got way more attention than it should have. I understand that that's what a lot of people find funny about it, but I just can't bring myself to upvote.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
